### Test delle API per gestione brand e icone

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7268

### Test 1: Ricerca Brand
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/brands/search?query=google
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 2: Ricerca Brand (Brandfetch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/brands/search?query=microsoft
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 3: Dettagli Brand
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/brands/brandfetch/details
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "brandId": "google.com"
}

###

### Test 4: Generazione Icona AI
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/icons/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "MyBrand",
  "style": "modern",
  "size": 256
}

###

### Test 5: Salvataggio Brand Locale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/brands/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Brand",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "color": "#3B82F6",
  "description": "Brand di test"
}

###

### Test 6: Verifica Stato Server
GET {{baseUrl}}/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

